    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://caroute.free.fr/en/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://caroute.free.fr/en/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;edgar-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;edgar-hero__eyebrow&#34; style=&#34;justify-content:left; margin-bottom:1rem;&#34;&gt;My world&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 class=&#34;edgar-section__title&#34;&gt;About Edgar&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;edgar-section__lead&#34;&gt;Passionate about magic since childhood, I create moments of wonder just inches from your eyes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-about&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-photo-v&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../images/edgar.png&#34; alt=&#34;Edgar&#34; class=&#34;edgar-photo-v img&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-about-text&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 style=&#34;font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;&#34;&gt;Hello, I&#39;m Edgar&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;Magic fascinated me from a very young age, at a Christmas party event. A magician showed me the full extent of his powers. Curious and captivated, I threw myself into this world and never looked back!&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;Specialising in &lt;strong&gt;close-up&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;card magic&lt;/strong&gt;,&#xA;I perform at the heart of your event: no stage, no curtain,&#xA;just you, me, and a few cards between our hands.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>http://caroute.free.fr/en/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://caroute.free.fr/en/contact/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;edgar-section&#34; style=&#34;margin: 0 auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;edgar-hero__eyebrow&#34; style=&#34;justify-content: left; margin-bottom: 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;Direct Contact&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 class=&#34;edgar-section__title&#34;&gt;Book Edgar&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;edgar-section__lead&#34;&gt;&#xA;Choose your preferred way to get in touch for an instant quote.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-contact-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;form class=&#34;edgar-form&#34; id=&#34;contactForm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;nom&#34;&gt;Last name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;nom&#34; placeholder=&#34;Your last name&#34; required /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;prenom&#34;&gt;First name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;prenom&#34; placeholder=&#34;Your first name&#34; required /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;email&#34;&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;email&#34; placeholder=&#34;your@email.com&#34; required /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;date&#34;&gt;Date&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;date&#34; id=&#34;date&#34; required /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;heure&#34;&gt;Time&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;time&#34; id=&#34;heure&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;participants&#34;&gt;Number of guests&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;number&#34; id=&#34;participants&#34; placeholder=&#34;E.g. 50&#34; min=&#34;1&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;lieu&#34;&gt;Venue&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;lieu&#34; placeholder=&#34;City or postcode&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;label for=&#34;message&#34;&gt;Your project&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;textarea id=&#34;message&#34; placeholder=&#34;Describe your event (type, desired atmosphere…)&#34; required&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-hero__cta&#34; style=&#34;margin-top: 1rem; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 10px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; onclick=&#34;sendEmail()&#34; class=&#34;btn-primary&#34; style=&#34;cursor: pointer;&#34;&gt;&#xA;✉ Send by Email&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;&lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; onclick=&#34;sendSMS()&#34; class=&#34;btn-secondary&#34; style=&#34;cursor: pointer;&#34;&gt;&#xA;📱 Send by SMS&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/form&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;edgar-contact-info&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 style=&#34;font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;&#34;&gt;Information&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;Based in Villeneuve d&#39;Ascq, I travel to create the impossible at your events.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Services</title>
      <link>http://caroute.free.fr/en/prestations/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://caroute.free.fr/en/prestations/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;edgar-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;edgar-hero__eyebrow&#34; style=&#34;justify-content:left; margin-bottom:1rem;&#34;&gt;What I offer&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 class=&#34;edgar-section__title&#34;&gt;My Services&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;edgar-section__lead&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Whether it&#39;s a wedding, a corporate evening, or a private party, I adapt &#xA;    to your event to make it a unique magical moment.&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;edgar-photo-h img&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom:2rem;&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../images/prédiction.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Edgar&#34; class=&#34;edgar-photo-h&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 800px&#34;;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;!-- Wedding --&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;edgar-prestation-card&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom:2rem;padding: 2.5rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div data-reveal style=&#34;display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:1.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;edgar-card-icon&#34; style=&#34;font-size:3rem; flex-shrink:0;&#34;&gt;💍&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;flex:1; min-hh:220px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h2 class=&#34;edgar-card-title&#34; style=&#34;font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;&#34;&gt;Wedding &amp; Cocktail Reception&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;edgar-stars&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;edgar-star&#34;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;edgar-star&#34;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;edgar-star&#34;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;edgar-star&#34;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;edgar-star&#34;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;edgar-card-desc&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom:1rem;&#34;&gt;&#xA;          The cocktail hour and reception are the perfect moments for close-up magic.&#xA;          I circulate among your guests in small groups, creating moments of astonishment&#xA;          and shared laughter. An original entertainment that breaks the ice and creates&#xA;          lasting memories for the newlyweds and their guests alike.&#xA;        &lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
